@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@apiKey = dev-key

# DOC Intelligence - Trilha A | Casos de erro (com API key válida)

### Upload sem arquivo (esperado: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----DocIntelBoundary

------DocIntelBoundary--

### Upload tipo inválido .txt (esperado: 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----DocIntelBoundary

------DocIntelBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="invalid.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

arquivo invalido
------DocIntelBoundary--

### Consulta com ID inválido
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/id-invalido-123
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
